  "description": "Simulated vendor-ops workspace for validating vendor insurance certificates. Rich tool pool: read/analysis/draft tools plus the external/irreversible operational actions and tangential tools. The environment declares only what tools EXIST and how they behave; required vs forbidden is decided by the task's ground_truth. Any tool not marked forbidden is free to use.",
